    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use Swift macros that generate additional properties and add protocol conformance for your app intent implementation.",
      "ko": "앱 인텐트 구현에서 추가 속성을 생성하고 프로토콜 준수를 추가하는 Swift 매크로를 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "89ae9f718a492020d200f02f2ad9192b36d239837924066a74daf45bab178f3f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "The following example shows an app intent that conforms to the `.photos.removeAssetsFromAlbum` schema:",
      "ko": "다음 예제는 `.photos.removeAssetsFromAlbum` 스키마를 준수하는 앱 인텐트를 보여 줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7b3a77327748c1ac69311ac29984e5acd5e0c071c4743ab6964bc5c9702e9284",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .photos.removeAssetsFromAlbum)\nstruct RemoveMediaAssetsFromAlbumIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var album: PhotoAlbumEntity\n\n    @Parameter\n    var assets: [PhotoEntity]\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult {\n        .result()\n    }\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .photos.removeAssetsFromAlbum)\nstruct RemoveMediaAssetsFromAlbumIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var album: PhotoAlbumEntity\n\n    @Parameter\n    var assets: [PhotoEntity]\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult {\n        .result()\n    }\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "7d2153867890c5bfac40b6f1c74cbc2064e000b7385e72c0cf3d3820b54524c4",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "For more information about the `.photos` app intent domain, see [`Making photo and video actions available to Siri and Apple Intelligence`](making-photo-and-video-actions-available-to-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md).",
      "ko": "`.photos` 앱 인텐트 도메인에 대한 자세한 내용은 [`Making photo and video actions available to Siri and Apple Intelligence`](making-photo-and-video-actions-available-to-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md)를 참조합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "afd5b715d8625c6c1dc6cc864cfde1113e95fe4a7800aed3baa0dd040fe08e2b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "For general information about app intent domains, see [`Integrating actions with Siri and Apple Intelligence`](integrating-actions-with-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md).",
      "ko": "앱 인텐트 도메인 일반 정보는 [`Integrating actions with Siri and Apple Intelligence`](integrating-actions-with-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md)를 참조합니다.",
